 fan from China. I love your art style so much that I would like to commission you to create an illustration for my original character.\nHer name is Jiang (Rivera). She is a 31 year old female, 166cm tall, with pale skin, dark brown hair and green eyes with heavy dark circles. She is cold-blooded and quiet, good at hiding her true thoughts. She is a workaholic who often works overtime and does whatever it takes to accomplish her goals. During the day, she handles paperwork in the office, while at night she secretly carries out assassinations to destroy her enemies. She smokes, and uses either a pistol or a short knife as a weapon.\nI really like the contrast between [Silent Worker] and [Dangerous Assassin], and I hope you'll draw the unknown dark side of her that operates at night and is covered in blood. You can play around with other details and make changes to clothing and weapons freely.\nPlease forgive me if there’re any offensive word. Wish you have a good day!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-4H4deigV5rw0Ou5mT8AsU_UTJFYJWWz", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@bisuka/works/6", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1481513, "client_id": 2212225, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b5327ba1/uploads/origins/e0b5c099-f66c-47f2-8d32-57215145fc3c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6087bfb8f1820e6ec44878af2f3ec733", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b5327ba1/uploads/origins/e0b5c099-f66c-47f2-8d32-57215145fc3c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6087bfb8f1820e6ec44878af2f3ec733, https://si.imgix.net/b5327ba1/uploads/origins/e0b5c099-f66c-47f2-8d32-57215145fc3c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2fbb2523475148221d48c918dce9ec5c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b5327ba1/uploads/origins/e0b5c099-f66c-47f2-8d32-57215145fc3c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b3bf1bd1f65c554cf2a23a66fab5f66b 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b5327ba1/uploads/origins/e0b5c099-f66c-47f2-8d32-57215145fc3c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6977f2236f575797ed0410d7a936fddc", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b5327ba1/uploads/origins/e0b5c099-f66c-47f2-8d32-57215145fc3c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6977f2236f575797ed0410d7a936fddc, https://si.imgix.net/b5327ba1/uploads/origins/e0b5c099-f66c-47f2-8d32-57215145fc3c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=501f4e06772c4beb26b9cc246acfeb99 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b5327ba1/uploads/origins/e0b5c099-f66c-47f2-8d32-57215145fc3c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=222aec2de5ca7fe6b6fcc07516533e2a 3x"}, "body": "こんにちは！私のキャラクター、Aulia Aruchaviの依頼をしたいと思います。彼女はフィリピンやタイなど東南アジアの文化に似たファンタジー帝国の飛行船の船長です。\n\n髪の色は黒を基調としたオンブレで、毛先近くは紫に変化している。上着の前身頃は開いていて、袖は肘まである。また、可能であれば短刀を抜いて肩にかける。刀身は水晶のような物質でできており、緑がかった色をしている。\n\nこれらの特徴以外は、自由に彼女を構成してください。ありがとうございました！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1aRUFZD0AZEsuRzn3P7knuDz4Wiehk1vn?usp=sharing", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@bisuka/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1481513, "client_id": 164516, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2685042b/uploads/origins/ff0c36a5-8bfc-4845-9c62-ce9f80e3e91f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=251041cad02c80f579916c1c6062fe8a", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2685042b/uploads/origins/ff0c36a5-8bfc-4845-9c62-ce9f80e3e91f?bg=